Fixes:
- Key repeated rows by their place in the list, so two rows with the same text both draw and keep their own state.
- Rank each bar against every other bar, not only those with another label, so two series with the same label take separate places.
- A time per step of zero divided by zero, a series with fewer values froze at its last one, and the figure inside the bars was always near-black; the step is at least one frame, a series that runs out fades off the board, and the figure takes a colour setting.

